íncipe cautivo","overview":"Mia decide convencer al príncipe Fernand, mientras que Philia busca el modo de protegerlos a todos.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11063833/screencap/6824be31b7eba.jpg","released":"2025-05-22T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt35437319:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. Contigo, porque me das valor","overview":"El príncipe Fernand se ha puesto del lado de Mia y Hildegarde, la antigua santa, le trae una propuesta.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11063834/screencap/682e24173011c.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt35437319:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"9. Encrucijada del destino","overview":"Con el tiempo en su contra, tanto Mia como Julius deciden poner en marcha sus planes.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11063835/screencap/683736652226d.jpg","released":"2025-06-05T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt35437319:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"10. Lo que quiero proteger","overview":"Girtonia por fin se centra en repeler el ataque demoníaco, ¿llegará a tiempo la ayuda de Philia?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11063836/screencap/68406998681fc.jpg","released":"2025-06-12T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt35437319:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"11. El archidemonio Asmodeus","overview":"Asmodeus revivió y su intención es quedarse con Philia, pero sus aliados no lo permitirán.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11063837/screencap/6849adffe22e9.jpg","released":"2025-06-19T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt35437319:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"12. La santa perfecta, abandonada por su prometido y vendida a otro país","overview":"Philia debe enfrentarse a Asmodeus y vencerlo de una vez por todas, pero no tendrá que hacerlo sola.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11063838/screencap/6853472cb859e.jpg","released":"2025-06-26T12:00:00.000Z"}]}}